        "default": "<p>Our award-winning DIBs culture is built with intention, creating empowered spaces where everyone can thrive, grow, and contribute authentically. From our employee resource groups (ERGs) to our DIBs Ambassadors, we're shaping what's next ? and building a more inclusive, inspired world.</p>"
