      {
        "item_title": "Accountability Is Our Foundation",
        "item_content": "<p>Every Highwire Walker sets a personal inclusion and belonging goal tied to their performance and growth. It?s how we keep DIBs top of mind, every day.</p>"
      },
      {
        "item_title": "Partnerships with Purpose",
        "item_content": "<p>We extend our impact through collaboration with community organizations focused on equity for historically marginalized populations ? because real change requires collective effort.</p>"
